  m_text: In this game you are a pilot and you need to deliver a package to the target,
    but the fuel is constantly running out and you need to pick it up in the rings.
    You have to keep the right height otherwise you will fall into the sea or make
    a dead loop. Be careful there will be airships and balloons on your way, dodge
    them! During the race you will receive coins, do not forget to upgrade your plane
    to fly further.
